OL,3,GNEWSABlossoms release song all about
OL,4,AManchester bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FStockport indie band Blossoms has
OL,7,Freleased a new song inspired by Greater
OL,8,FManchester's No. 192 bus.
OL,10,FAdditional Driver, featuring fellow
OL,11,Findie artist Declan McKenna, was born
OL,12,Ffrom a minor car collision involving
OL,13,Ffrontman Tom Ogden outside Manchester's
OL,14,FO2 Apollo.
OL,16,FThe song tells the story of a journey
OL,17,Ffrom Manchester to Stockport that goes
OL,18,Fwrong, with the repeated refrain:
OL,19,F"Should've got the 192".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
